---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.js';

const title = `Privacy Policy | ${site.name}`;
const description = 'How we collect, use, and protect your data.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <main class="privacy-page container-page pt-24 pb-24">
    <div class="privacy-header animate-on-scroll">
      <h1 class="privacy-title">PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
      <p class="privacy-subtitle">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-content animate-on-scroll" data-delay="100">
      <p>
        This policy explains what information BE Unconventional HQ collects when you visit the site, why we collect it, who else receives it, and what you can do about it.
      </p>

      <h2>Security & Bot Protection</h2>
      <p>
        To protect our website from spam and abuse, we use <strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong> in invisible mode. Turnstile may analyze browser and device characteristics to verify that you are a human, not a bot. This data is processed strictly for security and verification purposes and is governed by Cloudflare's standard retention and privacy practices.
      </p>

      <h2>Marketing & Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong>, <strong>Meta Pixel</strong>, and <strong>TikTok Pixel</strong> to understand our audience and measure how our content performs. These are loaded through Google Tag Manager.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>They use cookies and similar technologies to record page views, on-site events, and aggregate audience trends.</li>
        <li>To collect these measurements they necessarily receive technical identifiers such as your IP address, device and browser characteristics, and cookie identifiers. We do not upload customer lists, email addresses, or other contact details to these platforms.</li>
        <li>Once received, this data is held and processed by each provider under its own privacy policy and retention schedule, which we do not control.</li>
        <li>We do not sell your personal information.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Behavioural Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        We use <strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> to capture heatmaps and session replays showing how visitors move through the site. Clarity's default configuration masks text entered into form fields, so what you type into a form is not intended to be captured in a replay. Retention is governed by Microsoft's own policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Embedded Video</h2>
      <p>
        Some pages embed <strong>YouTube</strong> players. We use YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode, but once you play a video, YouTube receives your request directly and may set its own cookies. That interaction is governed by Google's privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Newsletter Subscriptions</h2>
      <p>
        If you submit your email address to our newsletter form, we store that address along with the date you subscribed. Subscriber records are held in <strong>Cloudflare KV</strong> storage on our own infrastructure, and are kept until you ask us to remove them or we retire the list. We use them only to send you updates about BE Unconventional HQ. We do not sell or rent them.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Form</h2>
      <p>
        Our contact form collects the name, email address, subject, and message you provide. Submissions are delivered to our editorial inbox by <strong>Resend</strong>, a third-party email delivery provider, and are used solely to respond to your enquiry. We do not sell or rent this information.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting & Infrastructure</h2>
      <p>
        This site is hosted on <strong>Cloudflare</strong>. As with any web host, Cloudflare processes requests to the site and may log technical information such as IP address, user agent, and timestamps for security, abuse prevention, and reliability.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights & Choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can limit analytics and advertising tracking through your browser's cookie settings or with an extension that blocks tracking scripts. Depending on where you live, you may also have the right to request a copy of the personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it, including removing your address from our subscriber list.
      </p>
      <p>
        To make any of those requests, email <a href="mailto:press@beunconventionalhq.com">press@beunconventionalhq.com</a> and we will respond as promptly as we reasonably can.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    min-height: 80vh;
  }
  
  .privacy-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .privacy-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, calc(1rem + 2.5vw), 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .privacy-subtitle {
    color: var(--color-accent-text);
    font-size: clamp(0.75rem, calc(0.375rem + 0.9vw), 1.1rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .privacy-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--color-white-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    background: rgba(10, 10, 12, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .privacy-content h2 {
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .privacy-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .privacy-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .privacy-content ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-content li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .privacy-content li::before {
    content: "•";
    color: var(--color-accent-text);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .privacy-content strong {
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
